\ Logical shift and validated pick/roll edges (no error paths here).
1 4 shift .            \ 16
256 -2 shift .         \ 64  (right shift by 2)
-1 1 shift .           \ -2  (logical: all-bits << 1)
10 20 30 2 pick .      \ 10  (third from top)
1 2 3 2 roll . . .     \ 1 3 2  (rot: bottom of 3 to top)
